title: Purpose
pid: 49bd84bc-4e0f-45c0-9ec3-c77088f9d42e
body: |2-
  Skg is for thinking, individually and collectively. It is a simple, novel way to write, collect (from other writers), organize and share information. (Any of which can be ignored -- you don't have to share, for instance, to use the app productively.) In a world of abundant information, I hope Skg will let users direct their attention, process information and collaborate more effectively.

  Skg begins from a [[id:05a14ad7-816b-41d0-bf9b-90155297d7a1][simple web-of-thought data model]] that [[id:bbb730bc-7ccc-413d-832d-4b6be0eb7b9e][many people already love]]. Its novelty is to extend that model [[id:ed6e9811-89a4-4fe4-b20b-3f383b5ef1aa][to integrate the thoughts of different users]].

  Technical doubts? See the small [[id:7d09cb7f-076d-4319-9416-d549ccd06d07][FAQ]].
